\"question\": \"According to the passage, what is one way to reduce waste and pollution?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Using non-renewable energy sources\", \"Recycling and reducing energy consumption\", \"Increasing water usage\", \"Minimizing waste and using biodegradable materials\"],\n      \"answer\": \"option3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"The passage suggests that some companies are using sustainability as a way to:\",\n      \"options\": [\"Save money on energy costs\", \"Increase their carbon footprint\", \"Sell environmentally friendly products\", \"Market themselves as eco-friendly\"],\n      \"answer\": \"option4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"The author of the passage implies that:\",\n      \"options\": [\"Sustainability is a fad and will soon disappear.\", \"Companies are genuinely committed to sustainability.\", \"The concept of sustainability has become too commercialized.\", \"We can achieve sustainability without making any changes to our daily lives.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"option3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"According to the passage, what is one benefit of adopting sustainable practices?\",\n      \"options\": [\"Reducing energy consumption\", \"Increasing carbon emissions\", \"Protecting natural resources for future generations\", \"Saving money on manufacturing costs\"],\n      \"answer\": \"option3\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
